(7649473, 1244265, 86218, '<td valign="top">Would love to see this rather as a BW image. Not sure that the blown out whites work in colour</td>', 'Would love to see this rather as a BW image. Not sure that the blown out whites work in colour', '2020-01-03 17:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7649549, 1244196, 156466, '<td valign="top">Well processed but the horizon is crooked</td>', 'Well processed but the horizon is crooked', '2020-01-04 16:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7649553, 1243746, 3306, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of potential with some specific editing. The vitality of the model is outstanding and the composition captures the moment beautifully. I really like the closeup angle but it does highlight some flaws. My opinion only. I would have corrected for the burned out areas on the nose and cheeks and the right eyelid. I would lighten the corneas of the eyes and the teeth slightly, Sharpened the pupils of the eyes slightly, and slightly softened the skin to smooth out the blemishes. None the less still a very appealing photograph!</td>', 'This has a lot of potential with some specific editing. The vitality of the model is outstanding and the composition captures the moment beautifully. I really like the closeup angle but it does highlight some flaws. My opinion only. I would have corrected for the burned out areas on the nose and cheeks and the right eyelid. I would lighten the corneas of the eyes and the teeth slightly, Sharpened the pupils of the eyes slightly, and slightly softened the skin to smooth out the blemishes. None the less still a very appealing photograph!', '2020-01-04 19:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
